    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Aura of Whispers"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(auditory, aura, divine, enchantment, fear, mental)\n\n30 feet.\n\nA gallowdead is surrounded by an aura of blasphemous whispers. A creature who hears them understands them to be mutterings of its most closely guarded secrets and private failings laid bare. A creature that first enters the area must attempt a DC 34 Will save. Regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune to aura of whispers for 1 minute. The frightened condition from this aura can't be reduced while in the aura.\n\nCritical Success: \nSuccess: \nFailure: \nCritical Failure: "
            },
            "id": "74e6c6d2-f299-47b6-9cb5-fe5a4991ac7c",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:28.527612"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Chains of the Dead"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The spiked chain of a gallowdead is wrapped around and through their body, imbuing it with foul necromantic powers. The spiked chain can't be disarmed, deals an additional weapon die of damage, and has a greater reach while wielded by the gallowdead."
            },
            "id": "74c67ee5-7825-415b-86b0-71d67a4ad14e",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:28.527612"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Gallow Curse"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, divine, necromancy)\n\nThose who destroy gallowdead are subject to a powerful death curse. When a creature reduces a gallowdead to 0 HP, the creature must attempt a DC 34 Will save. A creature that fails this saving throw is doomed 1 and can't remove the condition until the curse has been lifted."
            },
            "id": "5fdd6af6-b83a-4249-bda6-0780ea6b1a21",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:28.527612"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Eyes of the Tyrant"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Gallowdead are the eyes and ears of the Whispering Tyrant, so Tar-Baphon can see through them at any time as long as they're on the same plane of existence as him."
            },
            "id": "81cd4978-0e35-4256-a0cf-fd3df27f131a",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-03-17T12:41:28.527612"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Charge Chain[free-action]"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divine, necromancy, negative)\n\nFrequency: 1/round\n\nThe gallowdead imbues their chain with necromantic power. The gallowdead chooses to make their next Strike with the chain this turn either deal an additional 4d6 negative damage or have 120-foot reach."
            },
            "id": "0ee3ab2b-cb35-46c3-906e-3c55f3d12e76",
